WEBVTT

00:10.166 --> 00:14.500
What does it mean to you to return to Nir Oz?

00:24.733 --> 00:29.066
It took me some time to have the guts to come back

00:29.133 --> 00:31.866
and visit Kibbutz Nir Oz.

00:33.366 --> 00:36.566
People from overseas always ask me how...

00:36.566 --> 00:41.733
how it is to go back, how it feels,

00:42.433 --> 00:44.400
what is going on in your house.

00:45.900 --> 00:49.666
And it's really very hard to put into words.

00:50.366 --> 00:54.000
I wish you could all be here, because

00:55.266 --> 01:00.600
being here makes the information we know sink in

01:01.266 --> 01:05.233
and creates some kind of feeling

01:05.900 --> 01:09.500
that only those who know Nir Oz

01:09.500 --> 01:11.266
can understand Nir Oz.

01:12.500 --> 01:14.833
But thanks to photography,

01:14.833 --> 01:19.166
we can bring it as close to you as we can,

01:21.666 --> 01:24.300
so you can not only see,

01:24.300 --> 01:27.533
but maybe feel through the pictures,

01:28.566 --> 01:31.233
the silence of the dead,

01:33.333 --> 01:35.766
the beauty of the vegetation,

01:35.766 --> 01:38.766
the sounds of the birds in the sky,

01:39.366 --> 01:44.266
and the memory of so many people who

01:44.266 --> 01:46.566
were hoping to live in peace,

01:46.666 --> 01:49.366
and in good relations with their neighbors

01:49.733 --> 01:51.833
10 minutes away from here.

01:52.233 --> 01:54.433
People who worked hard,

01:54.433 --> 01:58.933
who lived modest lives, who were productive,

01:59.233 --> 02:01.666
who were loving and happy.

02:03.700 --> 02:07.000
And yet, through all this,

02:07.033 --> 02:12.966
even with 95% of the houses in this place burned,

02:14.300 --> 02:16.933
we see some hope growing.

02:17.733 --> 02:19.600
We will never forget.

02:21.033 --> 02:23.166
We will never stop hurting.

02:24.533 --> 02:27.233
But in order to continue living,

02:27.500 --> 02:32.100
we have to cling to hope and to the return

02:32.100 --> 02:33.866
of the people of Nir Oz,

02:34.900 --> 02:37.800
like my uncle and my aunt.

02:39.066 --> 02:44.366
We shall overcome, and light shall overcome the shadows.

02:44.466 --> 02:46.033
The shadows remain,

02:46.133 --> 02:49.166
and you can probably see them in the pictures,

02:49.433 --> 02:52.533
but there is no shadow without light.

02:53.533 --> 02:54.933
And...

02:55.833 --> 02:58.133
we concentrate on the light.

03:02.466 --> 03:04.166
I want to say something.

03:04.933 --> 03:10.666
I encourage every German citizen who wants to understand

03:10.666 --> 03:12.933
what truly happened

03:13.033 --> 03:16.166
to come and visit Israel.

03:16.766 --> 03:22.400
Please ask questions, please find out and seek the truth,

03:22.933 --> 03:25.366
and then judge for yourself.

03:25.900 --> 03:28.833
What do you feel? What do you think?

03:28.833 --> 03:30.966
And most importantly,

03:31.266 --> 03:34.566
what do you think should happen in the future?

03:35.000 --> 03:37.500
How can we strengthen Israel?

03:37.500 --> 03:42.900
How can we secure the safety of the people of Israel,

03:42.900 --> 03:45.466
who deserve to be in their land,

03:45.566 --> 03:47.233
but at the same time

03:47.233 --> 03:49.766
contribute to a better neighborhood

03:49.833 --> 03:52.200
and to rebuilding the region?

03:58.133 --> 04:03.133
What did you experience on October 7?

04:08.333 --> 04:13.333
I live in a village about 30 minutes away.

04:15.366 --> 04:20.333
I woke up to calls from my daughter, who said, "Mom,

04:20.333 --> 04:22.133
Mom, I hear terrible sounds."

04:22.133 --> 04:24.766
And within a minute, we had a siren.

04:24.766 --> 04:28.433
I ran with the whole family into the safe room,

04:28.566 --> 04:30.533
where we don't have any reception.

04:30.633 --> 04:34.233
We waited the amount of time we always have to wait,

04:34.233 --> 04:36.200
and we're very used to it,

04:36.300 --> 04:40.600
and came out. Then it sounded like hell.

04:41.000 --> 04:44.633
And I immediately called my cousin, who was there—

04:44.633 --> 04:47.133
here with her...

04:47.233 --> 04:49.733
two daughters. I spoke to her.

04:49.733 --> 04:52.300
She was absolutely terrified.

04:52.733 --> 04:55.933
We decided we would talk later,

04:56.000 --> 04:57.800
and I immediately called my aunt,

04:57.800 --> 04:59.766
who was already whispering and said,

04:59.766 --> 05:04.500
"I can hear Arabic. I can hear calls against us.

05:04.533 --> 05:06.733
I hear a terrible sound." And I told her,

05:06.733 --> 05:09.100
"So why are you talking to me?

05:09.100 --> 05:11.600
Stay in the safe room." And she said,

05:11.600 --> 05:13.166
"They're here, they're here."

05:13.166 --> 05:14.700
And I told her, "Please,

05:14.700 --> 05:15.633
please, aunty,

05:15.633 --> 05:18.366
hang up. I will call my parents.

05:18.366 --> 05:20.366
I will tell them not to call you."

05:20.366 --> 05:22.533
And we didn't for many hours,

05:22.533 --> 05:25.233
because we had no clue what was going on,

05:25.433 --> 05:29.933
but we wanted to be as safe as we could, to protect them.

05:30.400 --> 05:31.500
And later...

05:32.133 --> 05:35.833
later, we saw the terrible videos,

05:35.833 --> 05:40.266
the propaganda clips that the terrorists released,

05:40.400 --> 05:42.233
and we actually realized

05:42.233 --> 05:46.833
it was my aunt on the golf cart,

05:46.966 --> 05:49.000
and other people we knew.

05:50.300 --> 05:51.500
Later, we saw

05:51.500 --> 05:55.466
a picture of my uncle being carried by two jihadists,

05:56.166 --> 06:00.866
and we knew life would never be the same.

06:03.566 --> 06:05.333
What was your first impression

06:05.333 --> 06:07.900
when you came back to Nir Oz?

06:10.200 --> 06:13.133
It's really difficult for me to speak about time.

06:13.133 --> 06:17.266
I'm not sure how many months had passed. I think it was...

06:18.600 --> 06:19.500
maybe...

06:21.033 --> 06:21.933
four...

06:22.766 --> 06:24.466
three or four months.

06:25.333 --> 06:27.233
And the first time I came here,

06:27.233 --> 06:30.600
my heart was beating so fast.

06:31.566 --> 06:36.533
And what struck me was the fact that

06:36.533 --> 06:40.533
the birds were singing and everything was so green,

06:40.833 --> 06:45.266
but the smell was like hell,

06:45.500 --> 06:48.433
because for months and months and months,

06:48.633 --> 06:54.000
we could still smell the fire in the air,

06:54.000 --> 06:57.833
and that was devastating.

06:58.100 --> 07:01.300
And the sense of smell actually

07:01.533 --> 07:04.433
overwhelmed all the other senses,

07:06.000 --> 07:10.633
and it was just shocking. It was absolutely shocking.

07:11.766 --> 07:17.733
And it reminded me of the moral hell we are in,

07:17.833 --> 07:19.700
where we want to believe in peace,

07:19.700 --> 07:22.000
and we want to believe in coexistence.

07:22.000 --> 07:24.300
This is what I did all my life,

07:24.433 --> 07:29.466
lecturing on multiculturalism, diversity, coexistence.

07:30.800 --> 07:35.866
And now I need to deal with this piece of history,

07:36.033 --> 07:38.166
and I need to refine my thoughts,

07:38.166 --> 07:40.600
and I need to overcome my feelings,

07:40.933 --> 07:44.566
and I need to connect to the DNA

07:44.566 --> 07:48.466
of my humanistic view of the world.

07:49.233 --> 07:54.933
It's not easy. It's a challenge, but we are on the way.

08:00.433 --> 08:04.866
What will life here be like in a couple of months or years?

08:08.600 --> 08:10.666
When my uncle was released,

08:12.300 --> 08:15.133
when he was taken in the helicopter,

08:15.133 --> 08:18.366
he already said, "I know Nir Oz has been burned,

08:18.366 --> 08:21.733
but I shall come and rebuild Nir Oz."

08:22.000 --> 08:25.400
And that's what he is doing, along with other good people

08:25.400 --> 08:28.200
who managed and chose to come back,

08:28.200 --> 08:30.466
and others who will join them.

08:30.766 --> 08:35.033
And life takes over. We will never forget,

08:35.100 --> 08:38.133
but we shall continue living.

08:38.300 --> 08:42.300
And what you see now is a historical record:

08:42.766 --> 08:45.766
the burned houses, the burned remains,

08:45.766 --> 08:52.666
the death you see will be replaced by new houses, bigger,

08:53.166 --> 08:56.466
better education, resilience,

08:56.900 --> 09:01.466
lots of kids running, and again,

09:01.700 --> 09:05.733
life will return with the memory of what happened,

09:05.733 --> 09:09.333
with caution in what we say and how we act,

09:09.366 --> 09:11.700
but with a lot of hope.

09:15.033 --> 09:21.366
Terrorism will not win.

09:26.333 --> 09:29.866
Terrorism is a terrible philosophy.

09:30.600 --> 09:33.166
I'm not sure we will be able

09:34.833 --> 09:36.466
to cut its roots,

09:37.166 --> 09:41.366
but we will be able to work on better education

09:41.366 --> 09:43.133
for years and years to come.

09:43.133 --> 09:45.333
It will take a very long time,

09:45.333 --> 09:50.566
but we must believe that the right education will grow

09:50.566 --> 09:52.000
a different generation

09:52.000 --> 09:54.833
that chooses life over revenge and death.

09:55.766 --> 09:57.533
And they will not win.

09:58.566 --> 10:01.900
They might burn, but we rebuild.

10:02.066 --> 10:05.166
They might break, but we fix.

10:05.433 --> 10:09.566
Because we are stronger than this destruction.

10:09.666 --> 10:12.933
We are stronger than this atrocity.

10:13.200 --> 10:19.533
We are the power of humanity.

10:28.300 --> 10:41.700
How do you feel about the support from Europe

10:41.766 --> 10:47.966
and all the other countries that have abandoned Israel?

10:56.800 --> 11:00.166
I am very grateful for countries like Germany

11:00.166 --> 11:02.166
that were really very...

11:03.833 --> 11:07.800
supportive from the very beginning

11:07.800 --> 11:10.600
and showed solidarity.

11:10.600 --> 11:15.866
But there is something that I have to admit.

11:16.000 --> 11:18.833
As much as I want things to be prettier and

11:18.833 --> 11:22.366
more beautiful, they're not always like that.

11:22.800 --> 11:24.100
And...

11:26.000 --> 11:28.133
I wish the world leaders

11:28.133 --> 11:31.700
and the European leaders had pushed earlier.

11:31.733 --> 11:34.933
We're very hopeful that this is coming to an end,

11:35.333 --> 11:38.633
but this should have happened in November.

11:39.133 --> 11:42.833
We lost so many lives that we could have saved.

11:42.833 --> 11:47.333
We lost so many people,

11:47.333 --> 11:50.733
and the ripples of pain are growing and growing

11:50.733 --> 11:53.166
and growing across the whole state.

11:53.233 --> 11:55.466
It's not only our families,

11:55.466 --> 11:59.066
it's our communities and our cities and villages.

11:59.066 --> 12:01.133
And it's not only Israel,

12:01.133 --> 12:05.200
because the world is going through a catastrophe,

12:05.200 --> 12:09.066
a humanitarian... a humanitarian crisis.

12:09.733 --> 12:13.766
So why be so late? Why not act

12:15.966 --> 12:17.833
when it's happening?

12:17.966 --> 12:24.100
How could anyone let this continue for such a long time?

12:26.766 --> 12:28.466
I have no answers.

12:29.366 --> 12:32.466
But I am grateful for every hug

12:32.466 --> 12:36.033
and every effort that was made,

12:36.133 --> 12:40.133
sometimes without us seeing or knowing.

12:40.333 --> 12:45.633
I still believe that things were done,

12:45.933 --> 12:50.666
or were at least approached or started,

12:51.166 --> 12:54.500
because I still, whatever happens,

12:54.533 --> 12:56.100
believe in humanity.
